    "Description": "The container-tools module contains tools for working with containers, notably podman, buildah, skopeo, and runc.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* golang.org/x/crypto/ssh/agent: golang.org/x/crypto/ssh/agent: SSH client panic due to unexpected SSH_AGENT_SUCCESS (CVE-2025-47913)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
